  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Eliminating <math><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, vertex: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and focus: <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
